    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "This is the place. Enjoy some rest."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I thought I was going to the Notarial Hall or the Basilica, to be questioned about Arturia's escape."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "The gun-knight who brought you here has other business to attend to. He asked me to tell you not to worry about the Arturia case."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "Long has Landen Monastery served the Holy City dutifully. There will be no excessive penalty just because a single prisoner escaped."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_370_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Nun",
        "text": "Phew... that's good to hear."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "It was for another reason that you were brought here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "There are so many\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "Would you prefer a quieter location?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "No, what I mean is... why is everyone in this nursery Liberi?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
