    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_comfortbell",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Hildegard scans around the room and sees Liberi in all sorts of outfits, sitting or standing. There is little conversation, only the steady ring of the comfort bells."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hundreds? Thousands? Too many to count. An entire city's worth of Liberi seems to be assembled here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Since when did this nursery become so large? No, more importantly, why are all these Liberi here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "Don't tell me... you have a room full of Perros, a room full of Felines, a room full of Lupos...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "An astute observation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "We also have rooms for fallen angels and Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "You're... awfully forthcoming."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "The Shrine of Nurtury has nothing to hide."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "At the conclusion of the Nativity, the Curia announced that the Sankta will share the halo with all races. The simplest method is to do it race-by-race."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
