        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "So you brought me here, not because of Vannini, but because... I am Liberi?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "I'll get a big ol' light over my head, like yours?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Go on in, Pag."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Huh. Sounds like I don't have a choice. And it also sounds like a wonderful thing, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "At least it'll be good for your eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "More than that, I think!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "If I had a halo, I'd be able to tell what that metal heart of yours was feeling when you kicked Gia out of Laterano!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "I know you blame me for that."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Glad to know that you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Maybe things would've gone better for you, if that hadn't happened."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Over centuries of Lateran history, many have tried to recreate the terrifying high-caliber revolving antique gun that the ancient tomes described... only you succeeded."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "That design, which assumed the user could withstand a recoil five times that of an ordinary gun, was the work of a genius... or a madman."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Oh, are you bragging about being born to be a gun-knight? After all, you successfully tested my design before ever putting on a suit of armor."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "I just thought we were born to be partners. You and I and Gia were always the best of friends, from primary school through university."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "But my first official mission as a gun-knight was to exile Gia from Laterano..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "After that, you gave up gunsmithing for the Apostolic Knights, opened a workshop somewhere I didn't know about, and now..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "I decided to retire, alright? You and your <i>vappa</i> 'Shrine of Gunsmithing'. What use did you Sankta have for me, if you treat gunsmithing like making potato chips?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "It's a crime to be non-Sankta, is it? Gia got exiled, I get to have a halo put on me... the Liberi aren't allowed to live in Laterano the way we are now, are we?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "The thing with Gia had nothing to do with being Liberi. Even if she was Sankta, the Lateran wouldn't allow someone with Oripathy\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "You don't know shit!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "'Lateran order' and 'Lateran purity' again? How many times d'you think I've heard that garbage from you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Do you really believe in it yourself? <i>Somnias! Dormis!</i> How could you, if you've thought even once about how Gia died out there, alone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "I admit, I did believe in it, Patrizion. Until that day..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "We got hangovers together, played with guns together, cried and laughed together. No one in Laterano could clink glasses like we could."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "But when I saw Gia disappear into the wilderness, and you just turned around and went back to Laterano the way you did, that was when I realized..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "We never actually shared a damned thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
