    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "The halo is not a bad thing, Sister Hildegard. It's Laterano's blessing on us."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "From the earliest nomads who followed the burdenbeasts, the Liberi had always learned from the Sankta, from their ways of living, to their ways of thinking."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "The Liberi long for a better life, and they long to be part of the Holy City. We understand that."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I told that history to Arturia not so long ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "But there is only one thing the Liberi can never learn from the Sankta\u2014the halo."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "That is why certain conflicts between the Sankta and other races living in Laterano have lingered to this day."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "Unable to take part in Sankta empathy, you are troubled by doubts about your faith. You suspect Laterano of being indifferent, of alienation..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "To help with Landen Monastery's finances, you were away from Laterano for a long time, Sister Hildegard. That is why your may not have sufficient understanding of this situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "You can ask your fellow Liberi..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I know how many outsiders who live here envy your empathy."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "That is why we will now share it with everyone. There be no more misunderstandings or differences. We will truly understand one another, and eliminate the conflicts and barriers between us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "The Liberi will become a truly inseparable part of Laterano."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I just feel sad."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I grew up in this city. I know where one can find the best desserts, which alleys have cloudbeasts that have a special taste for pumpkins, which buildings have rooftops perfect for stargazing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "At Landen Monastery, I made beer and bread with the Sankta sisters, traveled to other countries to solicit sponsors, and got completely plastered whenever we came back..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I took pictures of how their wings went through the backs of their chairs when sleeping, and they played lullabies in the chapel when I sneaked out, so that the abbot would sleep a little longer."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_370_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Nun",
        "text": "I remember that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Nun",
        "text": "Actually, the abbot knew. He just didn't want to scold you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I'm a Lateran. I like this place. I love it very much."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "You're right that I often find myself on the outside looking in. I don't know why the Sanktas who had been crying a moment ago start laughing and singing at their cohorts' funerals."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "My father was a hunter. Every winter, he would go into the mountains with his friends to hunt."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "He told me that even hunters who have hunted together for decades can have different ideas when they see the same quarry. They sometimes even fight over it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "Everyone is different. That has nothing to do with whether or not we have a halo."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "But you tell me I won't truly become a Lateran until I have a halo."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "Do you mean to say that I wasn't a true Lateran for the past twenty years?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "Has my entire life been a poor imitation?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1786_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "It has, Sister Hildegard, but you should not see that as a rejection of you or any other Liberi."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "It is simply a necessity for the acceptance of Laterano."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I don't care about rejection or acceptance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I just don't think there's anything wrong with my life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "And I don't see a reason why I have to accept this so-called 'blessing'."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
