            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "It was the first time I experienced a parting, Pag."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "It... wasn't a good feeling."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "I guess that was when my life started to go off the rails."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "It's like those popcorn movies, you know. The <i>Chainsaw Guy</i> series, or <i>The Bridges of Michaelion.</i>"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "First Gia, then you, then my finest student. I exiled her from Laterano personally."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "I worry, too, about Fia..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "What, you're worried that your dear granddaughter might run away and you'll die alone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "You all had your issues. I tried to do something, but never actually helped anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Did you really try, or are you just lying to yourself to feel better?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Maybe both."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "But there's something you got wrong. I support the idea of halos for everyone, not only because I want to protect the 'order' and 'purity' of the Holy City..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "You're making Laterano sound awfully racist by putting it this way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "A Laterano where everyone shares the halo will truly become one and whole. We'll be able to solve the unimaginable calamity that threatens all of Terra."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "It'll also solve all the other problems we've been having, including..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Anyway, I think that's enough sharing for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "<i>Deo gratias!</i> Thank God that's over."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "Hearing all that garbage from you again is making me sick to my stomach."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Go on in, Pag."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "And if I say no?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "I don't want that light show you've got on your head. And I've got no interest in studying your honorable motives."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_sldrpllgn",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "Paganini levels his gun at the gun-knight."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Just give it a minute."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1781_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paganini",
        "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "You're a genius gunsmith, Pag, but you're a Liberi."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "You can't use the guns you make. They're just your calling cards."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "If you're really that furious with me, give it until the ceremony, then you can put a bullet in me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion",
        "text": "Once you have a halo, you'll be able to use it\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
